k after Evans recuperated from real-life surgery).\\n\\n-\\n\\nPEAKY BLINDERS\\n\\nIf filming on Season 6 had begun as originally planned, Helen McCrory — who played Aunt Polly to Cillian Murphy's Tommy Shelby (and is the wife of ... \",\"title\":\"https://tvline.com/lists/how-tv-shows-handled-death-of-an-actor/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d160\"},\"ref\":\"d160\",\"snippet\":\" ... Yet the bittersweet series doesn't trade in melodrama. In the Kings' hands, The Good Wife stays relentlessly rooted in the messy, shifting, ironic muddles of real life.\\n\\nAnd the Kings don't shy from controversy. Their sensitive depiction of complex court cases involving government secrecy, civil liberties ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.writermag.com/improve-your-writing/scriptwriting/the-good-wife/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d161\"},\"ref\":\"d161\",\"snippet\":\" ... Bill, born William Foster Hayes III, passed away in Los Angeles and his cause of death was not immediately known. He was 98.\\n\\nPeter Crombie\\n\\nActor Peter Crombie died on Jan. 10 following a quick illness that took his life, his ex-wife, Nadine Kijner, told TMZ. He ... \",\"title\":\"https://pagesix.com/celebrity-news/celebrity-deaths-2024/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d162\"},\"ref\":\"d162\",\"snippet\":\" ... the Character\\n\\nAmanda Sandford is a New York City advertising executive who desperately needs a break from the real world and the people occupying her busy life. On a whim, she books a weekend family getaway in a gorgeous house on Long Island with her husband and two ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.netflix.com/tudum/articles/leave-the-wor